                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5dc99a6a-c463-4710-ada0-a5c4b30aa87a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ebf9757a-8e7e-35c1-9a1c-7d5d59ab5de5",
                        "source_sense_id": "13ba21fd-2373-3096-acd4-344f3b4f24d0",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein Konzept mit festen Regeln, als Richtlinie des Handelns, zum Erreichen bestimmter Ziele",
                        "target_lang_word": "manifesto",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "manifesto",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                        "entry_id": "6b040bb7-8d9d-3ed1-bd85-08d1fb0bd78d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A public declaration of principles, policies, or intentions, especially that of a political party."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f31cd8d3-70d2-4e6d-a16c-724c20120858",
                                                "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                                "text": "As a piece of writing, the rambling and often contradictory manifesto has the pathos of the Unabomber manifesto but lacks the ideological coherency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b673af12-b758-4fe2-8255-b3edba71423a",
                                                "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                                "text": "the Communist Manifesto"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2374d6d-319e-43b8-8607-e940eed6c452",
                                                "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                                "text": "A creed is a manifesto of religious or spiritual beliefs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce10f05b-3125-4e37-950e-95c0789b66d0",
                                                "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                                "text": "During the worst days of Bolshevík tyranny, when book publishing had become impossible, the imaginists were a living reminder of undying freedom; they were the only independent group that were not afraid to make themselves noticed by the authorities, and they were wonderfully skilled in getting their slender little collections and manifestoes printed by fair means or foul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56a88ac7-2225-4dad-8f7c-32bf8230333c",
                                                "sense_id": "7cc636d4-f5f8-3b26-9fd4-6ed94724a45f",
                                                "text": "Beginning in summer 2022, such posters shared manifestos of an “e/acc” ideology squarely opposed to A.I. fearmongerers like the effective altruists and their fellow “decels” (aka “decelerationists”)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
